{
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "dataset_id": "orchestration_flow",
  "agent": {
    "sno": 35,
    "category": "Orchestration",
    "name": "Orchestration Flow",
    "tier": "tier_1",
    "target_examples": 28,
    "prompt_template": "ScholarSync orchestration regression contract (code-first — not LLM-generated).\n\nTarget function must emit flow_trace JSON with:\n  final_route, agents_invoked[], agents_bypassed[], route_events[],\n  flags{}, agent_inputs{}, agent_outputs{},\n  map_reduce_ok, template_missing, error\n\nEvaluators (orchestration_flow_evaluators.py):\n  1. trace_schema_validity — route + agents_invoked present\n  2. route_match — final_route == expected_route\n  3. agent_invocation_contract — required/forbidden agent sets\n  4. dependency_and_order_integrity — ordering + mutual exclusion\n  5. critical_handoff_integrity — scope→rewriter, rewriter→decomposer, map→reduce\n\nProduction entrypoints:\n  - Chat: chat_graph.py (Moderation → Memory → Intent → Retrieval/MapReduce → Generate)\n  - Studio: studio_service.py\n  - Problem solver: problem_solver_service.py\n  - Ingestion: ingestion.py / image_ocr.py\n\nDataset examples replay gold flow_trace in inputs; evaluators compare run output to gold contract."
  },
  "langsmith": {
    "dataset_name_prefix": "nbm-prompt",
    "input_keys": [
      "request",
      "flow_trace"
    ],
    "output_keys": [
      "expected_route",
      "required_agents",
      "forbidden_agents",
      "expected_order",
      "expected_handoffs"
    ]
  },
